---
import DirectoryLayout from "../layouts/DirectoryLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../config/site";
---

<DirectoryLayout
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  subheading={`How ${siteConfig.name} handles information, form submissions, and external links.`}
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "Home", item: "/" },
    { name: "Privacy Policy", item: "/privacy" },
  ]}
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Browsing Data:</strong> Our website is statically generated. We do not place invasive tracking cookies, browser fingerprinting scripts, or sell personal data.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Form Submissions:</strong> When you submit a community listing, report, or contact message, we collect the details you voluntarily provide (name, email, community URL, notes) to process your request.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">2. How Information is Used</h2>
      <p>
        Submitted data is used strictly for:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-600">
        <li>Evaluating community submissions and reports.</li>
        <li>Maintaining directory accuracy and removing broken or dangerous links.</li>
        <li>Responding to user inquiries.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Submitter or reporter email addresses are kept strictly confidential and are NEVER displayed publicly or shared with third parties.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">3. Outbound External Links</h2>
      <p>
        Our directory links to third-party platforms (Telegram, Discord, WhatsApp, etc.). When you click to join an external community, you leave our site and become subject to that platform's privacy policy and terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">4. Contact Regarding Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        For questions or requests concerning your data or community listings, contact us via our <a href="/contact" class="text-emerald-600 font-semibold hover:underline">Contact Page</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</DirectoryLayout>
